{"type":"message","id":"cb5618b0","parentId":"a3fcdb54","timestamp":"2026-05-25T09:42:20.840Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec_ts_ZTI0ODMwYTctNWNkNi00MmZlLTk5OGItZWU1MzllNzJiOWMz","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# We have two very interesting security and ecosystem stories:\n# 1. \"Based Apparel, linked to FBI Director Kash Patel, goes dark after being flagged for pushing 'ClickFix' wallet-draining malware targeting macOS/crypto.\" (Covered by Decrypt on May 24, also related to general crypto security)\n# 2. \"SEC postpones plan allowing 'innovation exemption' for tokenized stocks.\" (Covered by Cointelegraph on May 25, Decrypt on May 22, PYMNTS on May 24).\n# 3. \"Vitalik Buterin fires back at Ethereum Foundation critics, recommits to neutrality.\" / \"Vitalik Buterin says Ethereum Foundation will be a 'smaller ship,' sell less ETH amid researcher exodus.\" (Covered by Cointelegraph, The Block, KuCoin, CryptoRank, Cryptonews.net on May 24/25).\n# Let's check the Vitalik Buterin/Ethereum Foundation story! It has massive coverage across multiple feeds: Cointelegraph, The Block, KuCoin, CryptoRank, Cryptonews.net.\n# Let's verify the Cointelegraph URL for Vitalik Buterin story:\n# \"Buterin fires back at Ethereum Foundation critics, recommits to neutrality\"\n# URL: https://cointelegraph.com/news/buterin-fires-back-ef-critics-neutrality?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\ncurl -o /dev/null -s -w \"%{http_code}\\n\" \"https://cointelegraph.com/news/buterin-fires-back-ef-critics-neutrality?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\"\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","usage":{"input":49662,"output":409,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50071,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779702137066,"responseId":"exkUaoy0DJGC694PqZrx0AY"}}
