{"type":"message","id":"8c8212d0","parentId":"979b0261","timestamp":"2026-05-25T09:42:36.695Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec_ts_ZTI0ODMwYTctNWNkNi00MmZlLTk5OGItZWU1MzllNzJiOWMz","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# If that Google News redirect failed, let's find the direct link. The Block's URL is often:\n# https://www.theblock.co/post/... but let's look at the RSS feed of The Block if possible, or try fetching the KuCoin or Cryptonews.net piece.\n# Let's search the google news list for other URLs, or let's search via grep or curl for \"smaller ship\".\n# Let's search the google news XML output for KuCoin or Cryptonews.net or others.\n# KuCoin URL in Google News: \"Ethereum Faces Market Pressures and Internal Challenges Amid Talent Exodus\"\n# URL: CBMirAFBVV95cUxQTi0xMlV1cmd6R2s5Z3g0V1hJNGp2aDBraDN2bk9pTHBNcVhnVl9yMW1LVjZvazA1em1vZWpYeEdYLW1LODBGenFkSXRxdjRvZS1PcWZYc1F2YXV3NWNjLVEwdGs0aVd1WVFEZkZYd3kzeVI0OV85RUpWTHNCdEd0a3huWXFHM282SS1pUURVUjE1WU5PcWtnVnVQS2IyOVNqb2p5TFZ1Rdrg\n# Let's look up the KuCoin article using its actual title and website: \"https://www.kucoin.com/news/ethereum-faces-market-pressures-and-internal-challenges-talent-exodus\" or similar.\n# Let's use trafilatura on: \"https://www.kucoin.com/news/ethereum-faces-market-pressures-and-internal-challenges-talent-exodus\" (let's check if it exists)\ncurl -o /dev/null -s -w \"%{http_code}\\n\" \"https://www.kucoin.com/news/ethereum-faces-market-pressures-and-internal-challenges-talent-exodus\"\n# Let's check CryptoRank URL:\n# \"Ethereum’s selloff tests whether its neutrality-first model can defend ETH’s value amid Foundation ‘brain drain’\"\n# URL is in Google News. Let's see if we can get the direct URL from the XML, or we can use another tool.\n# Let's print out the exact links from Google News using python to resolve the base64 or decode the redirect.\npython3 -c \"\nimport urllib.parse, base64\ns = 'CBMi0gFBVV95cUxQMDlyMFBLbjVHWVM0Q0ZFNzlFZ3UyUUwwZ25FdDlCQmRvT0FhaEY1MnJiNDhPMTlWVzZteFpNNTczSUdsZDFvUUhwMU11RllDbjMwb0tQanZFRm8yeVhIal9MM19uME5kTmZ1bHQwMmtBVW5PSGdZMUR2WUNRQTBndFlHY3puZ1B1V3h0TTk0OTl4Wks1bGpzWXVKd0FfSkZ5enJjQ0FtcWFubmE4d3hFd2NlbTMzQ0pYeDlCbF95SjhXN1RnZTU4aXA3SkMxZU1KdlE'\nprint(base64.b64decode(s + '===').decode('utf-8', errors='ignore'))\n\"\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","usage":{"input":3373,"output":819,"cacheRead":47884,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":52076,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779702151620,"responseId":"iRkUapKTNqu60r4P5radqQM"}}
